Z||000012||Seanh||12-25-2000||10:07 PM||||I got a new HP notebook n5150 laptop computer. I have been wanting one for quite a while and now I have one. I dont like desktops because then you are confinded to one area and not able to go where you please. I am now sitting on the couch watching the Dallas vs. Tenn. game and surfing the net. I also got a MEAD computerized telescope (love summer astronomy, couldnt pay me to go outside now though). Money to buy Mr. Mikes leather seats, my Mom didnt know how to order them on the internet or which ones I wanted. Just to let you know I am getting the style 500, Dark gray w/lite gray inserts and the Fiero logo embroidered in red. Should look nice once I get the car done. Also got a new coat, and some cloths.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/transsig.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.kdsi.net/~sean" TARGET=_blank>Sean's Fiero Page</A><BR>Sean Heberly<BR>Silver 86 GT 2.8 Auto<BR>Going on to 3.4 in Jan.<BR><I>"It's always in the last place you look." Of course it is. Why would you keep looking after you've found it? Do people do this? Who and where are they?</I>||||reg||1
